# std::physics field pack: composes the
# EXISTING units/notation language packages — physics::classical laws,
# sci::physics::notation::nabla, sci::physics::notation::einstein — into one
# installable pack. Exports name existing registry cells (leaf spellings
# resolve canonically); nothing is forked or reimplemented. The installed
# image's lock lists every composed package (install_pack_composing).
package std

emath field_pack physics:
    exports:
        cell add
        cell exp
        cell sqrt
        cell norm
        cell inner_product
    metadata:
        description composes units nabla einstein notation packages
